  "description": "The proposal seeks householder planning permission for the replacement of the existing rear conservatory with a high-quality single-storey rear extension at 6 Woodbine Place, Wanstead, E11 2RH. The works include associated internal reconfiguration at ground floor level, two rear lantern rooflights, a new rear pivot door, a new oriel window and a new side arched window.\n\nThe proposal is located to the rear of the property, with no alteration to the principal front elevation. The design is modest, subservient to the host dwelling and intended to preserve the character and appearance of the conservation area. The proposed extension also respects neighbouring amenity and does not breach the 45-degree line.",
